### 내 대화방 목록
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v2/conversations

### 내 대화방 목록 - 2개씩
# @name firstConversations
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v2/conversations?limit=2

### 내 대화방 목록 - 다음 2개
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v2/conversations?limit=2&cursor={{firstConversations.data.nextCursor}}

### seoyeon과의 대화방 메시지
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v2/conversations/1/messages

### seoyeon과의 대화방 메시지 - 2개씩
# @name firstMessages
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v2/conversations/1/messages?limit=2

### seoyeon과의 대화방 메시지 - 그 앞 2개
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v2/conversations/1/messages?limit=2&cursor={{firstMessages.data.nextCursor}}

### 없는 대화방의 메시지
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v2/conversations/999/messages

